    "detailed_description": "<strong>A visual novel with dark humor, turn based combat, and stat building. Experience the fatal strength in companionship and the emotional bond that can come from it.</strong><br><br>You can expect to laugh and be surprised. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807600/extras/f0d318674bb7dd2a2c5bcb22195b1b10.avif?t=1693421424\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dark Humor<br></li><li>Tactical Turn Based Combat<br></li><li>Challenge - <i>Two difficulty levels so that you can have a casual or strategic playthrough.</i><br></li><li>Mystery - <i>Discover the truth about your cat.</i><br></li><li>Trust Building<br></li><li>Beautiful Art and Story<br></li><li>2 Unlockable Gallery Images<br></li><li>A Lot of Blood</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807600/extras/09933425a5954e7d123fc5cad58bc607.avif?t=1693421424\" /></div><br><br><strong>Your cat comes with 5 different abilities to slay foes with.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807600/extras/ce1785975c5e302b7466bbe2b9437e0f.avif?t=1693421424\" /></div><br><br><strong>Quotes From Play Testers:</strong><br><br><i>&quot;Game is funny, over the top, and fantastical. Wouldn't mind a sequel.&quot;</i><br><br><i>&quot;The humor was amazing, I was cracking up laughing throughout the entire thing. I had no idea what to expect but going through it I was not disappointed.&quot;</i><br><br><i>&quot;I really liked the combat style, it was cute and tactical at the same time.&quot;</i>",
